= PhD / Master students
Doctoral and Master students in the group

Each entry lists the student, the year they started, and their research topic. Students are
listed by their starting year, newest first.

== PhD students

- *Example Student One* \M PhD, since 2024.\n
  Research: learning-based power control in interference-limited networks.\n
  Email: [student.one@example.edu]
- *Example Student Two* \M PhD, since 2023.\n
  Research: reconfigurable intelligent surfaces for coverage extension.\n
  Email: [student.two@example.edu]
- *Example Student Three* \M PhD, since 2022.\n
  Research: energy-efficient scheduling with delay constraints.\n
